    "Description": "Provides host-local administration storage, authenticated identities and explicit owner configuration inside one C# library. Add one Superuser Bootstrap to your game's network scene and explicitly enable its editor switch for testing. Versioned transactions, retained backups, permissions, typed commands and authoritative dispatch are included. Durable action audit and UI remain pending.",
